        <h3>Butter The Children</h3>

        <p>
          Brooklyn dreampop band, 2012–2014. Members: Inna Mkrtycheva on vocals, Jordyn Blakely on
          drums (previously of Night Manager), J Boxer on bass, and Ray on guitar. Two releases at <a
            href="https://butterthechildren.bandcamp.com">butterthechildren.bandcamp.com</a
          >: the self-titled EP (2012) and <em>True Crime</em> (2014).
